{"vid":"8ip3fMwdhx0","source":"8ip3fMwdhx0.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"From BBC Learning English."},{"t":2.4,"txt":"This is Learning English from the News, our podcast about the news headlines."},{"t":7.2,"txt":"In this programme,"},{"t":8.3,"txt":"Facebook and Instagram's owner Meta is on trial again."},{"t":17.3,"txt":"Hello, I'm Becca. And I'm Phil."},{"t":19.8,"txt":"In this programme, we look at one big news story"},{"t":23,"txt":"and the vocabulary in the headlines that will help you understand it."},{"t":26.8,"txt":"You can find all the vocabulary and headlines from this episode,"},{"t":29.9,"txt":"as well as a worksheet on our website."},{"t":32.5,"txt":"That's bbclearningenglish.com"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"So, let's hear more about this story."},{"t":42.6,"txt":"Meta, the owner of Facebook, Instagram and WhatsApp has gone on trial in the US,"},{"t":48.5,"txt":"accused of breaking state and federal laws around child privacy."},{"t":52.9,"txt":"The lawsuit has been filed by 29 US states,"},{"t":56.1,"txt":"representing more than two thirds of the country's population."},{"t":59.2,"txt":"In this trial, four of these states California, Kentucky, Colorado"},{"t":63.8,"txt":"and New Jersey are making their argument."},{"t":66.7,"txt":"They claim that Meta designed Facebook"},{"t":68.7,"txt":"and Instagram to be addictive to children and teens,"},{"t":71.8,"txt":"and have misled users about the dangers."},{"t":74.7,"txt":"This is the largest of a number of lawsuits against Meta relating"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"to child safety."},{"t":79.8,"txt":"The company had previously been ordered to pay out"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"hundreds of millions of dollars."},{"t":84.2,"txt":"Meta denies the allegations, saying that it removes child accounts"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"and that it is taking steps to improve"},{"t":90.5,"txt":"teenagers' well-being on their platform."},{"t":93.2,"txt":"The trial is expected to last around six weeks."},{"t":96.7,"txt":"Let's have our first headline."},{"t":98.9,"txt":"This headline is from The Guardian, a British newspaper."},{"t":102.5,"txt":"US states take on Meta"},{"t":104.3,"txt":"in pivotal trial over child social media addiction claims."},{"t":108.8,"txt":"That headline again, from The Guardian,"},{"t":111,"txt":"a British newspaper."},{"t":112.3,"txt":"US states take on Meta"},{"t":114.5,"txt":"in pivotal trial over child social media addiction claims."},{"t":119,"txt":"The headline is from an article that talks about this lawsuit,"},{"t":122.5,"txt":"and also mentions other court cases that Meta has faced recently."},{"t":127,"txt":"The word that we're interested in here is 'pivotal'."},{"t":129.9,"txt":"Let's look at it in more detail, Phil."},{"t":132.2,"txt":"Something that's pivotal is the centre of everything."},{"t":135.6,"txt":"It's very important and other things depend on it."},{"t":139.2,"txt":"Yes, 'pivotal' comes from the noun 'pivot',"},{"t":142.4,"txt":"which is a point that everything else turns around."},{"t":145.8,"txt":"Here, it's saying that this particular lawsuit is especially significant"},{"t":150,"txt":"and could determine things in the future."},{"t":152.6,"txt":"It's pivotal."},{"t":154,"txt":"Let's talk about some other ways that we can use 'pivotal'."},{"t":157.3,"txt":"A pivotal figure is the most important person."},{"t":160.3,"txt":"They might play a pivotal role in making something happen."},{"t":163.8,"txt":"A pivotal issue is a very important one that can have a big impact."},{"t":173.4,"txt":"We've had 'pivotal' - very significant because other things depend on it."},{"t":181.4,"txt":"For example: The designer played a pivotal role in the company's success."},{"t":191.3,"txt":"This is Learning English from the News, our podcast about the news headlines."},{"t":195.9,"txt":"Today, we're talking about the latest lawsuit being faced by Instagram"},{"t":199.9,"txt":"and Facebook's owner, Meta."},{"t":202.2,"txt":"The potential damages that Meta may have to pay"},{"t":205.1,"txt":"should they lose this case have been estimated at $200 billion."},{"t":211.2,"txt":"Damages are the money that you have to pay the other side."},{"t":214.3,"txt":"If you lose a court case."},{"t":216.4,"txt":"The court could also force the company to make changes to its products."},{"t":220.5,"txt":"The states behind the lawsuit have asked for the removal of many"},{"t":224,"txt":"image filters and autoplay of videos,"},{"t":226.9,"txt":"and for the introduction of parental verification,"},{"t":230,"txt":"among other measures."},{"t":231.4,"txt":"This leads us to our next headline, and this is from CNBC, an"},{"t":235.6,"txt":"American business news organisation."},{"t":238.6,"txt":"Meta faces 'astronomical' consequences"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"as legal fight reaches critical moment in California."},{"t":245.4,"txt":"And that headline, again from CNBC."},{"t":248.6,"txt":"Meta faces astronomical consequences as legal fight reaches critical moment"},{"t":254.2,"txt":"in California."},{"t":255.6,"txt":"Let's find out what 'astronomical' means here."},{"t":259,"txt":"We can use 'astronomical' to say that something is related"},{"t":262.2,"txt":"to the study of space and the universe,"},{"t":264.6,"txt":"but that's not what's happening here."},{"t":267.1,"txt":"No, we can also use 'astronomical' metaphorically with numbers."},{"t":272.5,"txt":"You know how space is really big."},{"t":275,"txt":"Well, an astronomical number is a really big number."},{"t":279.6,"txt":"We just mentioned the $200 billion in damages."},{"t":284,"txt":"That is an astronomical amount of money."},{"t":287,"txt":"When the headline says that matter could be facing astronomical consequences,"},{"t":291.5,"txt":"it's talking about how large and severe these consequences could be."},{"t":296.6,"txt":"We often use 'astronomical'"},{"t":298.7,"txt":"together with money and quantity words, an astronomical figure,"},{"t":303.3,"txt":"an astronomical amount and an astronomical sum."},{"t":311.5,"txt":"We've had 'astronomical' -"},{"t":313.8,"txt":"very large."},{"t":318.2,"txt":"For example:"},{"t":319.4,"txt":"To buy a mansion like that must cost an astronomical amount of money."},{"t":329,"txt":"This is Learning English from the News from BBC Learning English."},{"t":332.7,"txt":"We're talking about the latest lawsuit to be faced by Meta."},{"t":337.4,"txt":"Much of the focus of this story is about the potential harm to teens."},{"t":342,"txt":"The state's case says that Meta knew how Instagram could take advantage"},{"t":346.6,"txt":"of teenagers' brains."},{"t":348.4,"txt":"Meta denies this, and presented a study showing many teenagers"},{"t":351.9,"txt":"feel better about themselves after using Instagram."},{"t":355.5,"txt":"Here's our next headline."},{"t":357.4,"txt":"This headline is from The Washington Post, an American newspaper."},{"t":361.8,"txt":"Zuckerberg faces potential reckoning in court over Instagram's effects on teens."},{"t":367.7,"txt":"That headline, again from The Washington Post, an American newspaper."},{"t":371.4,"txt":"Zuckerberg faces potential reckoning in court over Instagram's effects on teens."},{"t":377.6,"txt":"The word that we're interested in here is 'reckoning'."},{"t":381.5,"txt":"'Reckoning' has a few related meanings."},{"t":383.8,"txt":"It can be a calculation or an estimate."},{"t":387.4,"txt":"A reckoning can also be a judgement,"},{"t":389.6,"txt":"and that is the sense that is being used here."},{"t":392.4,"txt":"When the headline says that Zuckerberg is facing a potential reckoning,"},{"t":396.7,"txt":"it means that he's facing a judgement and potential consequences."},{"t":400.9,"txt":"'Reckoning' is quite an old fashioned word that we don't use in everyday speech"},{"t":405.8,"txt":"in this context."},{"t":407.4,"txt":"There are expressions like 'day of reckoning' or 'the final reckoning',"},{"t":411.8,"txt":"but we'd usually see these written in books."},{"t":415,"txt":"What's more common is the verb 'reckon', which means 'estimate' or 'think'."},{"t":423.7,"txt":"We've had 'reckoning' - a judgement and its related consequences."},{"t":428.7,"txt":"For example: The politician will face his reckoning on election day."},{"t":433.8,"txt":"That's it for this episode of Learning English from the News."},{"t":437.2,"txt":"We'll be back next week with another news story."},{"t":440.1,"txt":"If you've enjoyed this programme, don't forget to sign up"},{"t":443.3,"txt":"for our newsletter to find out about all the different programmes that we have,"},{"t":447,"txt":"and you can find the link to sign up for it in the notes below this programme."},{"t":452.2,"txt":"That's it for now, bye! Bye!"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"From"},{"t":0,"w":"BBC"},{"t":0,"w":"Learning"},{"t":0,"w":"English."},{"t":2.36,"w":"This"},{"t":2.36,"w":"is"},{"t":2.36,"w":"Learning"},{"t":2.36,"w":"English"},{"t":2.36,"w":"from"},{"t":2.36,"w":"the"},{"t":2.36,"w":"News,"},{"t":2.36,"w":"our"},{"t":2.36,"w":"podcast"},{"t":2.36,"w":"about"},{"t":2.36,"w":"the"},{"t":2.36,"w":"news"},{"t":2.36,"w":"headlines."},{"t":7.2,"w":"In"},{"t":7.2,"w":"this"},{"t":7.2,"w":"programme,"},{"t":8.32,"w":"Facebook"},{"t":8.32,"w":"and"},{"t":8.32,"w":"Instagram's"},{"t":8.32,"w":"owner"},{"t":8.32,"w":"Meta"},{"t":8.32,"w":"is"},{"t":8.32,"w":"on"},{"t":8.32,"w":"trial"},{"t":8.32,"w":"again."},{"t":17.32,"w":"Hello,"},{"t":17.32,"w":"I'm"},{"t":17.32,"w":"Becca."},{"t":17.32,"w":"And"},{"t":17.32,"w":"I'm"},{"t":17.32,"w":"Phil."},{"t":19.8,"w":"In"},{"t":19.8,"w":"this"},{"t":19.8,"w":"programme,"},{"t":19.8,"w":"we"},{"t":19.8,"w":"look"},{"t":19.8,"w":"at"},{"t":19.8,"w":"one"},{"t":19.8,"w":"big"},{"t":19.8,"w":"news"},{"t":19.8,"w":"story"},{"t":22.96,"w":"and"},{"t":22.96,"w":"the"},{"t":22.96,"w":"vocabulary"},{"t":22.96,"w":"in"},{"t":22.96,"w":"the"},{"t":22.96,"w":"headlines"},{"t":22.96,"w":"that"},{"t":22.96,"w":"will"},{"t":22.96,"w":"help"},{"t":22.96,"w":"you"},{"t":22.96,"w":"understand"},{"t":22.96,"w":"